{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Arc 0: The Failed Isekai</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/7d6edbc0c0f546d9861fbde216b4ca15.poster.avif?t=1769467189\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/7d6edbc0c0f546d9861fbde216b4ca15.webm?t=1769467189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/7d6edbc0c0f546d9861fbde216b4ca15.mp4?t=1769467189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Welcome to the year 2027!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Haruto Saito, a member of Japan\u2019s Self-Defense Forces, who has spent years fighting in distant lands for his country. Like any dangerous job, it was never going to end well. One day, Haruto loses everyone under his command and, by a cruel twist of fate, ends up the only survivor. <br><br>When he returns home, guilt and regret gnaw at him as he faces a society still rattled by the war\u2019s aftermath. With nowhere left to belong, Haruto risks being forcibly committed to a newly established rehabilitation facility for soldiers, a place that feels less like \u201chelp\u201d and more like a one-way ticket to a psych ward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/9c212d9c02ef52e94adee0a1282cb491.poster.avif?t=1769467189\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/9c212d9c02ef52e94adee0a1282cb491.webm?t=1769467189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/9c212d9c02ef52e94adee0a1282cb491.mp4?t=1769467189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Naturally, by the laws of the genre (and with a little help from the plot engine), fate isn\u2019t about to let our not-quite-fully-formed protagonist off the hook. Haruto has a chance encounter with a mysterious man who offers him a job as a teacher, or rather, a guardian, for four troubled teenagers in a new rehabilitation project called <strong>Quiet Classroom</strong>. It\u2019s his last shot at avoiding forced commitment. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/d00a984703d4475512f68c4401c5da54.poster.avif?t=1769467189\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/d00a984703d4475512f68c4401c5da54.webm?t=1769467189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/d00a984703d4475512f68c4401c5da54.mp4?t=1769467189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, Haruto meets his future students and frankly, they\u2019re a pretty textbook bunch. Now he has to choose: take on the responsibility of other people\u2019s lives, just as tragic as his own\u2026 or keep swallowing horse-sized doses of sedatives in a mental hospital every morning. Which option sounds better? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/2477a3c5a5bb85c4fe0069f21cac51a7.poster.avif?t=1769467189\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/2477a3c5a5bb85c4fe0069f21cac51a7.webm?t=1769467189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/2477a3c5a5bb85c4fe0069f21cac51a7.mp4?t=1769467189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>See how this grand story begins in the 90-minute demo of the comedy-drama visual novel Quiet Classroom!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>OVER 30 HIGH-QUALITY ANIMATED ILLUSTRATIONS</strong> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>FULL VOICE-OVER INCLUDING THE MAIN CHARACTER\u2019S THOUGHTS</strong> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>ATMOSPHERIC AND BEAUTIFUL SOUNDTRACKS</strong> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A SURVIVAL MINI-GAME, A SECRET ENDING, AND, OF COURSE, A CRAZY STORY FILLED WITH DELIGHTFULLY CLICH\u00c9D ANIME-STYLE JOKES!</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>THEY NEED YOU. GO!</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3441730?t=1769467189","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/7af45d04943e60431ace7872e7a8dd609ce5338d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769467189","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/9f34088435160557425f04974b1ded98363aa673/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769467189","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/9f34088435160557425f04974b1ded98363aa673/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769467189","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","i